      "bio_summary": {
        "value": "My name is Maxwell Alejandro Frost . I’ve spent my life as an organizer, fighting for the future we deserve. I’m running for Congress because I know we won’t change the system until we change our leadership. It’s time for poor, working-class, and young people to have a seat at the table. As the first generation-z member of Congress, from day one , I will fight to end gun violence, win Medicare For All, transform our racist criminal justice system, and end the climate crisis.",
